      "lines": [
        "879．因式分解：",
        "а) $x^2-y^2-2(x-y)$；　　　　　　　б) $x^2-a^2+5(x+a)$；",
        "в) $4a^2-b^2-2a+b$；　　　　　　　г) $a^2-4b^2-a-2b$；",
        "д) $a^2+5a+5b-b^2$；　　　　　　　е) $x^2-3x+3y-y^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "880",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "880．求出函数 $y=\\frac{x^2-25}{x-5}$ 的定义域．作出这个函数的图象．",
        "这个函数图象与函数 $y=x+5$ 的图象有什么不同？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "881",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "881．作函数 $y=\\frac{9-x^2}{x+3}$ 的图象．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "882",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "882．约分：",
        "а) $\\frac{(x-y)^2}{x^2-y^2}$；　　　　　　　　　б) $\\frac{(x-2)^2}{x^2-4}$；",
        "в) $\\frac{x^2-9}{(3-x)^2}$；　　　　　　　　　　г) $\\frac{1-x^2}{(x-1)^2}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "883",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "883．化简：",
        "а) $\\frac{a^2-25}{7a^3}\\cdot\\frac{21a^2}{2a-10}$；　　　　　б) $\\frac{6x^6}{9-x^2}\\div\\frac{3x^3}{3y-xy}$；",
        "в) $\\frac{a^2-b^2}{2a-b}\\div\\frac{b^2-ab}{4a-2b}$；　　　　г) $\\frac{x-ax^2}{ax-2}\\cdot\\frac{2ax-4}{a^2x^2-1}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
